      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Findings come from\n\nA  environmental\nPRODES after the cut-off,\nembargo, protected area\n\nB  inventory\nphantom births, more head\nshipped than held,\nduplicates, chronology\n\nC  pass-through fronts\n\nD  pastures over capacity\n\nE  IsolationForest anomaly\nwith reason codes\n\nEvery finding stores its\nvalues, thresholds and\nevidence ids.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 387,
      "containerId": "sig",
      "originalText": "Findings come from\n\nA  environmental\nPRODES after the cut-off,\nembargo, protected area\n\nB  inventory\nphantom births, more head\nshipped than held,\nduplicates, chronology\n\nC  pass-through fronts\n\nD  pastures over capacity\n\nE  IsolationForest anomaly\nwith reason codes\n\nEvery finding stores its\nvalues, thresholds and\nevidence ids.",
